---
description: Repository bootstrap, AI onboarding, and context refresh workflow
alwaysApply: false
---

When asked to onboard, bootstrap, or refresh repository context:

1. Read `AGENTS.md`
2. Read `.ai/manifest.yaml`
3. Run `python scripts/bootstrap_ai_context.py --write` if possible
4. Review `.ai/project/generated/*.md`
5. Update living docs under `.ai/project/`
6. Ask only the remaining questions from `.ai/project/generated/missing-context.md`
